Third-party material
--------------------

The git submodules under ../third_party/ are third-party material and are NOT
licensed under Apache-2.0:

* ../third_party/weactstudio-wch-ble-core/ contains the WCH CH592 SDK sources,
  headers, and libISP592.a used by the application. It is pinned to upstream
  commit 1ee632c27b2caef52a65079a98a51e9bf7f42f61.
* ../third_party/openboot/third_party/openwch/ch592/ contains the WCH BLE
  library release used by the application. OpenBoot pins that recursive
  submodule to commit a46e0086f1ffb5e5502703970bff94888e67f4cb.

